      "Title": "Invex.Extensions.Hosting.Service.CycleBackgroundService",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Invex.Extensions.Hosting.Service.CycleBackgroundService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">A <xref href=\"Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.BackgroundService\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> that performs work in fixed-cadence cycles in the background.\nDerived classes specify how often the cycle runs via <xref href=\"Invex.Extensions.Hosting.Service.CycleBackgroundService.CycleCadenceMs\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> and implement the\nper-cycle work in <xref href=\"Invex.Extensions.Hosting.Service.CycleBackgroundService.ExecuteCycleAsync(System.Threading.CancellationToken)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.</p>\n"
    },
